333
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:26,799
Believe me now?

334
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:30,960
Song Qing

335
00:20:32,559 --> 00:20:33,359
No need to see me off.

336
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,720
Stop messing around, you hear me?

337
00:20:38,759 --> 00:20:39,720
I hate you.

338
00:20:41,319 --> 00:20:42,000
Do you have to force me to say

339
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:42,720
