348
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:14,440
I've written two martial arts manuals!

349
00:21:14,559 --> 00:21:15,960
Seven or eight men can't even touch me!

350
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:17,440
So what if you're a wild beast?

351
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:18,720
Wolves, bears,

352
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,720
