353
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,720
I'll kill you in three punches!

354
00:21:21,799 --> 00:21:22,720
Try me if you don't believe it!

355
00:21:23,559 --> 00:21:24,359
You think I...

356
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:37,920
Come at me if you dare!

357
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,720
One-on-one!

358
00:21:40,039 --> 00:21:40,839
Freeze!

359
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:49,920
Vile beast, cease your attack!

360
00:21:59,160 --> 00:21:59,880
Master, come quickly!

361
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:00,880
Look.

362
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:02,559
Look.

363
00:22:06,759 --> 00:22:08,480
Benefactor, apologies for the scare.

364
